{"title":"1999 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/3/403b658407c0554b61c76956b1458b4ca7347462.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3^{2} + 7^{2} - 5^{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"96\" height=\"18\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/e/c2e83e9063a54bbe7104df3aa7a1df686258fd9c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ (A) }\\ 75 \\qquad\\text{ (B) }\\ 83 \\qquad\\text{ (C) }\\ 33 \\qquad\\text{ (D) }\\ 25 \\qquad\\text{ (E) }\\ 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"433\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Following <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Order_of_operations\" title=\"Order of operations\">order of operations</a>, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/e/9cee35e38fae196e1c262550b09cc07016427c50.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3^{2} + 7^{2} - 5^{2} = 9 + 7^{2} - 5^{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"207\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/9/cc9311cae9fe6c8e68a7cf27918d6eaa8ae28e45.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=9 + 49 - 5^{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"109\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/e/f9e71d8d2436491d292b37b3f2c94b29748cde95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=9 + 49 - 25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"111\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/4/ca49dda4220a534ee60e94f027703dff91983c04.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=58 - 25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"80\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/a/8faf12e9627945cb7ceda662267b0c2f35a108b3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\boxed {\\textbf {(C) } 33}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"86\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Cayley\" title=\"1999 CEMC Cayley\">1999 CEMC Cayley</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Cayley_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1999 CEMC Cayley Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Cayley_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1999 CEMC Cayley Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First Problem</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1999 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1999 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Cayley_P